    {
      "children": [],
      "content_layer": "body",
      "formatting": null,
      "hyperlink": null,
      "label": "text",
      "meta": null,
      "orig": "It's almost the end of Q3, which means annual (and quarterly) planning is just around the corner. If you’re like most people, this sentence just filled you with dread.",
      "parent": {
        "$ref": "#/body"
      },
      "prov": [],
      "self_ref": "#/texts/18",
      "text": "It's almost the end of Q3, which means annual (and quarterly) planning is just around the corner. If you’re like most people, this sentence just filled you with dread."
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content_layer": "body",
      "formatting": null,
      "hyperlink": null,
      "label": "text",
      "meta": null,
      "orig": "We've been through dozens of planning cycles after spending 10 years at",
      "parent": {
        "$ref": "#/groups/2"
      },
      "prov": [],
      "self_ref": "#/texts/19",
      "text": "We've been through dozens of planning cycles after spending 10 years at"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content_layer": "body",
      "formatting": {
        "bold": true,
        "italic": false,
        "script": "baseline",
        "strikethrough": false,
        "underline": false
      },
      "hyperlink": null,
      "label": "text",
      "meta": null,
      "orig": "Eventbrite",
      "parent": {
        "$ref": "#/groups/2"
      },
      "prov": [],
      "self_ref": "#/texts/20",
      "text": "Eventbrite"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content_layer": "body",
      "formatting": null,
      "hyperlink": null,
      "label": "text",
      "meta": null,
      "orig": "and seven years at",
      "parent": {
        "$ref": "#/groups/2"
      },
      "prov": [],
      "self_ref": "#/texts/21",
      "text": "and seven years at"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content_layer": "body",
      "formatting": {
        "bold": true,
        "italic": false,
        "script": "baseline",
        "strikethrough": false,
        "underline": false
      },
      "hyperlink": null,
      "label": "text",
      "meta": null,
      "orig": "Airbnb",
      "parent": {
        "$ref": "#/groups/2"
      },
      "prov": [],
      "self_ref": "#/texts/22",
      "text": "Airbnb"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content_layer": "body",
      "formatting": null,
      "hyperlink": null,
      "label": "text",
      "meta": null,
      "orig": ", so we've seen firsthand how messy and challenging it can be. Sometimes we were still working on our annual plan — three months into the year. Other times a half-assed plan was rushed through approvals, only to be abandoned entirely after only six months. For most of us, by the time planning ends we’re left with bruised egos, misaligned plans, and a lack of buy-in.",
      "parent": {
        "$ref": "#/groups/2"
      },
      "prov": [],
      "self_ref": "#/texts/23",
      "text": ", so we've seen firsthand how messy and challenging it can be. Sometimes we were still working on our annual plan — three months into the year. Other times a half-assed plan was rushed through approvals, only to be abandoned entirely after only six months. For most of us, by the time planning ends we’re left with bruised egos, misaligned plans, and a lack of buy-in."
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content_layer": "body",
      "formatting": null,
      "hyperlink": null,
      "label": "text",
      "meta": null,
      "orig": "On the flip side, we've also seen the power of a great planning process. In one case, a single team took it upon themselves to consistently stay ahead of planning. They were always ready to rock and roll on day one of the quarter, and as a result delivered significant impact more quickly (and with higher morale) than anyone else.",
      "parent": {
        "$ref": "#/body"
      },
      "prov": [],
      "self_ref": "#/texts/24",
      "text": "On the flip side, we've also seen the power of a great planning process. In one case, a single team took it upon themselves to consistently stay ahead of planning. They were always ready to rock and roll on day one of the quarter, and as a result delivered significant impact more quickly (and with higher morale) than anyone else."
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content_layer": "body",
      "formatting": {
        "bold": true,
        "italic": false,
        "script": "baseline",
        "strikethrough": false,
        "underline": false
      },
      "hyperlink": null,
      "label": "text",
      "meta": null,
      "orig": "Planning is hard because it's inherently different from other exercises your organization takes on",
      "parent": {
        "$ref": "#/groups/3"
      },
      "prov": [],
      "self_ref": "#/texts/25",
      "text": "Planning is hard because it's inherently different from other exercises your organization takes on"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content_layer": "body",
      "formatting": null,
      "hyperlink": null,
      "label": "text",
      "meta": null,
      "orig": ". Rather than focusing on day-to-day execution, it requires a large number of people to think about a variety of possible futures, align on one single future, and then plot a concrete course to get there. Taking this on for your own personal goals (for example, a New Year’s resolution), feels challenging enough — doing this with dozens or thousands of people can feel nearly impossible.",
      "parent": {
        "$ref": "#/groups/3"
      },
      "prov": [],
      "self_ref": "#/texts/26",
      "text": ". Rather than focusing on day-to-day execution, it requires a large number of people to think about a variety of possible futures, align on one single future, and then plot a concrete course to get there. Taking this on for your own personal goals (for example, a New Year’s resolution), feels challenging enough — doing this with dozens or thousands of people can feel nearly impossible."
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content_layer": "body",
      "formatting": null,
      "hyperlink": null,
      "label": "text",
      "meta": null,
      "orig": "You can’t expect the organization to “just know” how to pull together a quarterly plan. Working without an agreed-upon framework can often be a recipe for disaster.",
      "parent": {
        "$ref": "#/body"
      },
      "prov": [],
      "self_ref": "#/texts/27",
      "text": "You can’t expect the organization to “just know” how to pull together a quarterly plan. Working without an agreed-upon framework can often be a recipe for disaster."
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content_layer": "body",
      "formatting": null,
      "hyperlink": null,
